-		<DefineName>RF_SCORING_DELAY_MULTIPLIER_PERCENT</DefineName>
+	<!-- These two settings determine when scoring happens. The first one is
+		 for the first chapter and second one for the penultimate chapter. (The
+		 final chapter is only scored if the AI wins, and then it's scored
+		 immediately.) The other chapters are interpolated.
+		 For all chapters (except the final one), scoring has to happen during
+		 the subsequent chapter and at least 5 turns away from the start and
+		 end of that chapter. 50 and 25 (recommended) means that the first
+		 chapter is scored in the middle of the second chapter, and the
+		 penultimate chapter one quarter into the final chapter. -->
+	<Define>
